    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["JL…-C", "PL…-S"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Non-automatic electromechanical weighing instrument with or without lever works; compact weighing instrument with built-in display, keyboard and data interface. The weighing ranges (Max, verification scale intervals, number of verification scale intervals and scale intervals) may be selected within the limiting values of table 1. The JL…-C is meant for use as a 'jeweller instrument' and differs metrologically from a PL…-S instrument only in that carat is preset as a fixed unit; in all other respects the two instruments do not differ metrologically."
  },
  "model_family": {
    "family_name": null,
