        }
      ],
      "description": "Weighing ranges comprising Max, verification scale intervals, number of verification scale intervals and scale intervals may be selected within these limiting values. Max, e and d are expressed in the unit given in the 'unit' column (ct or g). Tare-balancing range is ≤ 100 % of Max. Applies to both certified models JL…-C and PL…-S.",
